{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "小津じゃーん！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobiLPC6M.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！こんばんは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小津玲奈です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大阪公演\nありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "会場の熱気が高く\nたこ焼きのように\nアツアツなライブでした！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "暑い中来てくださった方、\n心の中で応援してくださった方\n本当にありがとうございました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "エスカレーターの右側に乗ったり\n聞こえてくる言葉が関西弁だったりと"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大阪に着いた瞬間から\n全身で「大阪」を感じました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobuKIFjE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大阪城ホールと大阪城が\n近くてとっても嬉しかったの🏯"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大阪城は歴史がたっっっくさんあって\n語りきれないよね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また今度旅行でも行きたいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大阪といえば"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "天下の台所！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "れいな博士！！\nなぜ天下の台所というのですか？？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "😴Zzz"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はぁ、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回のれいな博士は\n食い倒れて寝てしまいました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次回こそは登場してほしいですね〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ということで小津が解説します"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "江戸時代に日本中の年貢や特産品が\n大阪に集められ、\n全国の物流の中心地として機能していたため\n天下の台所と呼ばれるようになったんだとか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たこ焼き、豚まん、串カツ、お好み焼き、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "美味しいものが多くて\n現在でも天下の台所だね！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "塩で食べるたこ焼きが\n美味しすぎたの！！\nまた食べたいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobmmHuy6.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみに、れいな博士は\n辛い物攻撃が効かないから\nたこ焼きロシアンルーレットは\n最強なんだとか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつか6期生で\nたこ焼きパーティーをしたいなぁ！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type":